{"source_id":"W732","platform":"RSS","author":"Eurogamer","account_type":"メディア","text":"At Dead of Night sequel The Great Hugo is coming \"(very) soon\"\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/Screenshot-2026-11-01-at-18.12.02.png?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Baggy Cat Games, the team behind viral FMV horror game At Dead Of Night, has confirmed that a sequel is \"coming (very) soon\".</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/at-dead-of-night-2-the-great-hugo-sequel-announced\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.eurogamer.net/at-dead-of-night-2-the-great-hugo-sequel-announced","timestamp":"2026-11-01T18:16:20Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
{"source_id":"W732","platform":"RSS","author":"Eurogamer","account_type":"メディア","text":"Modern Warfare 4 on Switch 2 has much worse input lag than PS5\n<img src=\"https://assetsio.gnwcdn.com/cod-modern-warfare-4-captain-price.jpg?width=690&amp;quality=85&amp;format=jpg&amp;auto=webp\" /> <p>Call of Duty: Modern Warfare 4 on <a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/platforms/switch-2\">Switch 2</a> has noticeably worse input lag than on PS5, which could put Nintendo players at a disadvantage in multiplayer.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.eurogamer.net/modern-warfare-4-switch-2-input-lag-digital-foundry\">Read more</a></p>","url":"https://www.eurogamer.net/modern-warfare-4-switch-2-input-lag-digital-foundry","timestamp":"2026-11-01T17:27:29Z","extra":{"source_priority":"medium","source_genre":"games","source_type":"メディア"}}
